    "document": "Event Companion",
    "section": "Doubles Event Companion",
    "summary": "Under Transports, a unit from either army in a unified force can start the battle inside the other army’s TRANSPORT. Check the TRANSPORT’s usual eligibility requirements before embarking. In an ADEPTUS ASTARTES unified force, for example, one player’s Techmarine could start aboard their teammate’s Impulsor.",
